    <string name="help_a1">Yonke imisebenzi egciniwe ingena emizuliswaneni ka-YEBO/CHA. Izinketho ezingakwazi ukuthola iningi ziyasuswa, ezisele ziqhubekela phambili, futhi eyesokugcina iwina. Izibalo zamavoti zibonakala ngaso sonke isikhathi ngemva kokuvalwa komzuliswano.</string>
    <string name="help_a2">Iqembu lakho, imibono namavoti kugcinwa kudivayisi. Ukwengeza noma ukuvota ungenalo uxhumano kufakwa isikhathi, kufakwa emgqeni, futhi kuthunyelwa lapho uxhumano lubuya. Uma omunye umuntu eshintshe into efanayo, i-VIBE ikukhombisa ukungqubuzana esikhundleni sokukushintsha ngokuthula.</string>
    <string name="help_a3">Yebo. Izilungiselelo zine-English, isiZulu neSesotho, kanye netimu emnyama nekhanyayo. Izaziso zilandela ukukhetha okufanayo.</string>
    <string name="help_a4">Umnikazi weqembu uqala umzuliswano, kodwa ilunga ngalinye lithola ivoti elilodwa lika-YEBO/CHA ngomsebenzi ngamunye.</string>
